# Yarn Classic enforces the engines field fatally, and @solana-program/token >=0.14.0 publishes a Node 24
# floor its runtime does not need (solana-program/token#160 added it for repo tooling). Installs on
# Node 22 would hard-fail with yarn while npm, pnpm, and bun only warn, so engine checks are off.
--ignore-engines true
